# ===================== PROVISIONAL (September matrix, until S04 is redone) =====================
# Outputs go to results/provisional/ and every figure/table says "provisional: September RMSD matrix".
# Input: results/task_outputs/block_10/rmsd_entry.npy plus its row-order file in the same folder. If no row-order file exists, log BLOCK.

T P01 S run "Provisional: clusters at 1.0/1.5/2.0/2.5 A, Shannon entropy, threshold sensitivity"
  help Average linkage on the September matrix; one label column per cut; entropy (bits) per cut; number of clusters and top-3 share per cut, plus one figure. Check that the 1.5 A cut reproduces 9 groups (212, 124, 6, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1); if not, log PART with the difference. Save the script in scripts/.
  meta wk=7 who=B ph=core
  tool scipy, numpy, matplotlib
  out results/provisional/clusters.csv
  out results/provisional/entropy_sensitivity.csv
  out figures/provisional_threshold_sensitivity.png
  chk csv results/provisional/clusters.csv rows>=300 cols=entry_id,cut_1.0,cut_1.5,cut_2.0,cut_2.5 nonempty=entry_id uniq=entry_id
  chk csv results/provisional/entropy_sensitivity.csv rows>=4 cols=cut,n_clusters,top3_fraction,entropy_bits
  chk file figures/provisional_threshold_sensitivity.png

T P02 S run "Provisional: cumulative diversity curve and 90% saturation N"
  help 100 random orderings; mean and SD of clusters seen for N=1..351 at each cut; the N where the mean reaches 90% of the total; one figure with the 90% line. Fixed random seed, recorded in the CSV.
  meta wk=7 who=B ph=core
  needs P01
  tool numpy, matplotlib
  out results/provisional/diversity_curve.csv
  out results/provisional/saturation.csv
  out figures/provisional_diversity_curve.png
  chk csv results/provisional/diversity_curve.csv rows>=300 cols=cut,n,mean_clusters,sd_clusters
  chk csv results/provisional/saturation.csv rows>=4 cols=cut,n_90,seed
  chk file figures/provisional_diversity_curve.png

T P03 XS run "Provisional: QC-conditioned clustering delta"
  help Recluster without entries failing combined QC (results/entries.csv); per cut report clusters, top-3 share, entropy, n_90 with and without, and which clusters disappear.
  meta wk=7 who=B ph=core
  needs P01 P02
  out results/provisional/qc_delta.csv
  chk csv results/provisional/qc_delta.csv rows>=4 cols=cut,set,n_entries,n_clusters,entropy_bits

T P04 S run "Provisional: chemistry cluster x structural cluster test"
  help Join each selected entry's ligand of interest (Q18) to its chemistry cluster (C11) and its 1.5 A structural cluster (P01). Contingency table, count of cells with expected < 5, chi-squared p and a permutation p (shuffle at ligand level, 10000 permutations). Report n. Never write p as None.
  meta wk=7 who=C ph=core
  needs Q18 C11 P01
  tool scipy, pandas
  out results/provisional/chem_struct_test.csv
  chk csv results/provisional/chem_struct_test.csv rows>=2 cols=test,n,statistic,p_value,method nonempty=p_value

